    "story": "## Purpose\n\n`hwy_members` is the organizational membership record (Arabic identity, nakhebin link, membership summary, address, education, job). Platform login lives on `base_users` via `user_id`.\n\n## Scenarios\n\n- **S1 Self-registration** — draft member (public tracking = member id) + minimum files (`personal_photo`, `national_card_front`, `national_card_back`).\n- **S2 Call-center wizard** — duplicates check (workflow metadata), nakhebin link (`nakhebin_*`), referrer decision, then `membership_status` → pending local.\n- **S3 Local verification** — updates `membership_status`, `membership_on`, audit fields.\n- **S4 Live dossier** — notes, files, security profile rows, institute links (child tables).\n\n## Rules\n\n- List/search truth for Arabic labels is this row, not only the platform profile.\n- Approval history is Workflow + record events; status columns are operational summary only.\n- Do not store passwords, blobs, or legacy Limits columns here.",
